  mask: binary mask M where M[r,c]=1 iff cell is black
  constraint: at least 1 black and 1 foreground cell (solver asserts both)
  output: Kronecker product M kron M; true cells get foreground color, false cells black
  #  Input example:        Black mask:     Output = kron(mask, mask) recolored
